componentsJoinedByString joins by position, not by identity.

The separator was appended for every element that was not the same OBJECT as -lastObject, a
pointer comparison. An array whose elements are all one interned instance therefore joined into a
single run with no separators at all.

iA Writer builds its library query placeholders as three @"?" and got

  SELECT Item.path FROM Item JOIN Content ON Item.rowid = Content.rowid
  JOIN Location ON Item.locationid = Location.rowid WHERE Item.path IN (???)

which sqlite rejects with near "?": syntax error. FMDB reports that and returns nil rather than
raising, so the file list simply stayed empty and the only sign was a DB Error line in the
application's own log.

